<title>SPAIN: Endesa to pay interim 100 pta gross div.</title>
<headline>Endesa to pay interim 100 pta gross div.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish electricity firm Empresa Nacional de Electricidad (Endesa) said it would pay a gross interim dividend for 1996 of 100 pesetas per share effective January 3.</p>
<p>Last year, the company paid an interim gross dividend of 84 pesetas per share and a final gross dividend of 102 pesetas.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom + 34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
